affine/evernote clone

this is supposed to be a project inspired on both affine and evernote
for now, lets keep it as only a web app.

stack
- go
- htmx
- tailwind
- postgresql
- s3 (rustfs) - not necesary, but will be available if we need to store files


main features we need
- multiple users
- only admin can create user by email invite
- workspaces
  - folders
  - tags
  - support for writting code, with syntax highlight
  - autosync/autosave
  - deal with multiple users editing single file simultaneously (i still dont know how to)
  - capacity to share workspaces or folders
  - file import (enex, html, md, txt)
  - file search by folder, tag, title, author, timestamp, words in text
